  "notes": "Blue Moon's 4-piece set. Reached only when that Moon's 1/56 trigger hits; the draw is uniform over the pieces NOT yet obtained, so each piece carries an ownershipGate and effectiveWeightedPool shrinks the denominator as pieces are collected (4 unowned -> 1/4 each; 1 unowned -> certain). Duplicate protection is scoped PER SET, not across all 12 uniques \u2014 Jagex's own correction post explicitly rules out the '1/56 for any item across all sets' reading. The drop table's flat 1/224 per item is the naive first-piece-only figure and is deliberately NOT used as a rate here. Source: Lunar Chest, ==Loot mechanics==, revid 15284737."
